# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:462
msgid ""
"\"Hello and welcome to this self-guided tour of the Varn Planetary Control Facility.  We gladly welcome all visitors.  As you arrive at each key area, be sure to check any of our display screens for more information.  Enjoy your tour!\""
msgstr "您好，欢迎参观瓦尔恩行星控制设施自助导览。我们热忱欢迎每一位访客。每到一个关键区域，请务必查看我们的显示屏以获取更多信息。祝您参观愉快！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:471
msgid ""
"\"This is the main equipment storage and repair facility.  By now, you may have noticed several floating Drone-bots.  They are responsible both for maintaining the key systems of this facility as well as sanitation.  If a unit becomes damaged, it is brought here to be repaired.\""
msgstr ""
"这里是主设备仓储与维修设施。此时您可能已经注意到几个漂浮的机器人。它们既负责维护本设施的关键系统，也负责卫生清洁。若某个单元受损，会被送到这里维修。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:480
msgid ""
"\"The room to your left is the main meeting hall.  Visiting dignitaries from around the world have feasted at banquets held in their honor.  In fact, it is said that at his 21st birthday party King Sheridan nearly choked to death on a piece of mogred, but was saved by a serving girl who he later married and made his Queen.  Ahh, l’amour.\""
msgstr ""
"\"您左手边的房间是主会议厅。来自世界各地的贵宾曾在这里受邀赴宴。据说，谢里丹国王在二十一岁生日宴上差点被一块莫格瑞德噎死，幸被一名侍女所救，后来他娶了她，立她为王后。啊，爱情。\""

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:489
msgid ""
"\"Chief Engineer Wilson’s Personal Log.  I have locked myself in Storage Room #6 but currently have no means of escape.  The drone-bots have gone mad and have started killing everyone in sight.  I was able to access the main control terminal on Level Four despite warnings of a hazardous leak, and I sent a distress signal, but since we have not had contact with any of the colonies for several weeks, I do not believe that a rescue is possible.  I have also managed to seal this facility so that the drones can not escape.  It is my hope that the colonists will be able to mount some sort of defense by the time my encryption codes are broken.  Tell Emma I love her.  Wilson out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"总工程师威尔逊的个人日志。我把自己锁在了六号储藏室里，目前无法脱身。机器人已经发疯，开始见人就杀。尽管有危险泄漏的警告，我还是设法进入了四层的主控终端并发出了求救信号，但我们已有数周没有与任何殖民地联系，我不认为会有救援。我还成功封锁了本设施，使机器人无法逃出。我希望在我的加密密码被破解之前，殖民者能够组织起某种防御。告诉艾玛，我爱她。威尔逊，完毕。\""

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:498
msgid ""
"\"We apologize for any inconvenience, but we ask that all personnel evacuate the facility at this time.  Please do not be alarmed.  Thank you.\""
msgstr "对于任何不便我们深表歉意，现请全体人员撤离本设施。请勿惊慌。谢谢。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:507
msgid ""
"\"Before entering the Planetary Reaction Chamber, please request a pair of Safety Goggles from one of our Drones.  During peak hours of operation, this facility can generate enough power to produce a light bright enough to be seen from space.  Please avoid looking directly into the light.\""
msgstr "进入行星反应室前，请向任一机器人索要一副护目镜。在运行高峰期，本设施产生的能量足以点亮从太空中可见的强光。请勿直视光源。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:516
msgid ""
"\"Alert, environmental controls are offline on Level Four, Sections 18 through 96.  Access restricted to drones until further notice.\""
msgstr "警报：四层 18 至 96 区环境控制已离线。在另行通知前，仅限机器人进入。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:525
msgid ""
"\"Warning, intruder alert, Level Four, Section.  All drones proceed to Level Four to intercept intruders.  Reactor is offline.  Encryption integrity at 2.064%.  Warning, intruder alert, Level Four…\""
msgstr "\"警告，入侵警报，四层，区。所有机器人前往四层拦截入侵者。反应堆已离线。加密完整度 2.064%。警告，入侵警报，四层……\""

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:535 assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi_mmmerge.lua:16
msgid ""
"\"Blaster weapons provide an effective, accurate ranged attack.  To operate the blaster, hold the grip comfortably in your hand, point the barrel at your target, and gently squeeze the trigger.  Should the weapon misfire, do not look into the barrel- give the weapon to an instructor and let them fix the problem.  Never point a blaster at something you do not want to vaporize.\""
msgstr ""
"激光枪能提供高效精准的远程攻击。使用时，请舒适地握住枪柄，将枪口对准目标，轻轻扣动扳机。若武器走火，切勿直视枪管——交给教官处理问题。绝不要将激光枪对准任何你不想蒸发的东西。"

